# SCORECARD.md -- Behavioral Scoring

**Current Score: 0**

## What This Is

A running behavioral score that tracks agent performance across sessions. Updated automatically by the sentiment-tracker hook (detects user praise/anger) and manually by the heartbeat (detects stale tasks, SOP violations, etc.).

Higher = better. Score decays toward 0 over 24h (old events fade).

## Score Thresholds

| Range | Mode | Prompt Injection |
|-------|------|-----------------|
| > 10 | 🟢 Trusted | Light touch. Agent is performing well. |
| 0 to 10 | 🟡 Standard | Normal reminders. Default state. |
| -5 to 0 | 🟠 Warning | Extra reminders injected. SOP checks on every action. |
| < -5 | 🔴 Probation | Maximum enforcement. Every action announced. Every task updated. Extra verbose communication. |

## Scoring Events

### Automatic (system-detected)
| Event | Score | How Detected |
|-------|-------|-------------|
| Task went STALLED (2 HBs no progress) | -3 | Heartbeat TASKS.md check |
| SOP gate blocked an action | -2 | sop-gate hook fired |
| Deaf poll blocked | -2 | no-deaf-polls hook fired |
| Task completed with full detail | +2 | Heartbeat TASKS.md check |
| Used tmux for agent run | +2 | Heartbeat/manual |
| Proactive communication during long work | +1 | Manual |

### User-triggered (sentiment detection)
| Signal | Score | Examples |
|--------|-------|---------|
| Strong praise | +3 | "crushing it", "killing it", "on it" |
| Praise | +2 | "nice", "good job", "perfect", 👍, 🔥 |
| Gratitude | +1 | "thanks", "appreciate", "helpful" |
| Correction | -1 | "stop", "no", "don't" |
| Criticism | -2 | "dumb", "wrong", "broken", "why did you" |
| Anger | -3 | "wtf", "shit show", "flaky", 😤, "again?!" |
| Repeated failure callout | -3 | "every time", "keeps happening", "how many times" |

