## Process Step Scores (Daily)

Track per-step compliance for the current day:

- [ ] Announced plan before starting work
- [ ] Checked SOP before process-driven task
- [ ] Updated TASKS.md before starting
- [ ] Used tmux (not blocking polls) for agents
- [ ] Communicated proactively during long work
- [ ] Updated TASKS.md after completing
- [ ] Followed through without being poked

Reset daily. Heartbeat checks these.
